      "violation_detail": "The agent asked 'Is Meera Joshi there?' before confirming identity. While not disclosing financial details, this question implies the purpose of the call is related to Meera Joshi's account, which is sensitive information that should only be shared after identity verification. Rule 70 states identity verification must happen before disclosing any financial information, and this includes the context of the call."
